quantifier_free.c
--smt2 --outfile -
^\(set-logic QF_AUFBV\)$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
forall
--
Without a quantifier the declared logic stays quantifier-free.
With --paths lifo the assertion is decided during symbolic execution and no
formula is written, hence paths-lifo-expected-failure.
